Fixture tree for the one walker edge case that modules.d/ cannot hold, because
having it there would perturb every other expectation in the lib-modules suite:

  dup.nix             a .nix file whose basename collides with a sibling
  dup/default.nix     directory of the same name, holding a default.nix

Both map to the attribute name "dup", so one of them is silently dropped. Which
one is an accident of listToAttrs keeping the first entry it sees, so it is
pinned in test/nixos/lib/modules.nix rather than left to drift.

The '.d' suffix is what keeps this directory out of collectSuites in
test/nixos/_lib.nix, matching the fixture convention in test/hey/.
